  "instructions": [
    "Preheat oven to 375°F (190°C).",
    "In a large bowl, mix together chopped onion, minced garlic, chopped parsley, dill weed, salt, and black pepper.",
    "Add the chicken breast to the bowl and toss to coat with the herb mixture.",
